What the inside quantifier is is really quite meaningless - you have claimed
 that the "typical" of "lo'e" is an abstraction that need not exist (but on the
other hand it may exist in large numbers if you are talking about lo'e [clone]).
I would agree that "ro" is a sutiable inside quantifier since however many
